<title>FRANCE: WARBURG HAS 134 FFR USINOR TARGET - DEALERS.</title>
<headline>WARBURG HAS 134 FFR USINOR TARGET - DEALERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg has a price target of 134 francs for steel group Usinor Sacilor SA, which recently joined the CAC-40 index of blue-chip shares, French fund managers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Warburg said in a note that the share is less expensive than those of Hoogovens or British Steel.</p>
<p>At 1039 GMT, Usinor was down 0.36 percent at 111.00 francs  while the CAC was down down 0.2 percent at 2918.31. Usinor has gained 48 percent so far this year.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
